Section 4 - EQDRC runtime components (NOT in this repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
The on-device EQDRC chain this tuner drives - the ALSA
libasound_module_pcm_eqdrc.so plugin, the closed-source
librkaudio_effect_eqdrc.so algorithm library, and the factory
parameter bins - is distributed by Rockchip with the RK SDK and is
not redistributed here. Obtain those components from Rockchip; see
the "runtime prerequisites" section of the README. The only file
under eqdrc-runtime/ is asound.conf-sample (this project's text,
MIT).

Vendored LVGL builds: lib/x86/liblvgl.so and lib/aarch64/liblvgl.so
are unmodified rebuilds of upstream LVGL 8.4.1 (MIT) compiled with
this project's include/lv_conf.h plus the tiny src/misc/lv_systick.h
tick shim in Section 1. They are MIT-licensed LVGL builds; rebuild
instructions are in the README.
